Project Title: fbi_violence_analysis.pdf
Description: Analysis of different violence types commmited throughout the U.S. during years 2015-2019 tracked by FBI.
Script fbi_violence_code.Rmd is markdown file that imports excel files from data_files to be used to generate PDF.
Requirements: PDF viewer, R, Excel
Quick Start: Place data_files folder in location, update .Rmd file to import from location and run script to generate PDF.
Data is static, so will only generate the report that is found as fbi_violence.analysis.pdf
